  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ふしぎな　ねんぱを　じったいかして\nあいてを　こうげきする。\nぶつりてきな　ダメージを　あたえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "이상한 염력파를 실체화하여\n상대를 공격한다.\n물리적인 데미지를 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將神奇的念力波實體化後攻擊對手。\n給予對手物理傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur matérialise des ondes mystérieuses\nqu’il projette sur l’ennemi. Inflige des dégâts physiques.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender erzeugt eine seltsame Energiewelle, die dem\nZiel physischen Schaden zufügt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Crea una onda psíquica que causa daño físico al\nobjetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio facendo materializzare\nmisteriose onde psichiche che provocano danni fisici.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user materializes an odd psychic wave to attack\nthe target. This attack does physical damage.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不思議な　念波を　実体化して\n相手を　攻撃する。\n物理的な　ダメージを　与える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将神奇的念波实体化攻击对手。\n给予物理伤害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Crea una onda psíquica que causa daño físico al\nobjetivo.",
